      "created_at": "2020-06-09T18:08:02.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>When I first kickstarted this project, I had intended to load it into multiple devices and share those with my gaming group during character generation. That way everyone would be able to make a character without my having to share copyrighted material.</p>\n<p>But now that the entire state is in lockdown, the face-to-face games have moved to online games.</p>\n<p>How are other groups handling this? How do your players make characters when you're the only one with the rule book?</p>",
