      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/d/eada6e/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2020-06-09T19:35:52.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I'm converting a campaign from another system, so I made the PCs, and I'm giving the players a chance to re-visit them later if they want to make changes.</p>\n<p>Perhaps they could give you concepts and you could make them?</p>\n<p>Or it could be done as a fairly complicated but not impossible online session with one book.&nbsp; Or numerous shorter sessions one on one with each player.</p>",
