      "created_at": "2020-06-09T19:43:33.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>It's not too bad using the Guided method.&nbsp; Just have people roll and tell them what their options are.&nbsp; Copying and pasting just those bits should be considered fair use over a private medium.&nbsp; Just don't post it to a public Discord or anything.&nbsp; Constructed would be a bit harder, they'd have to tell you what they want and you'd have to help choose what seems to fit best.</p>",
